  "comment": "DOGWOOD-SHARP-D3-PREP-01 contract-resolution fixtures. One fixture is one request, expressed once and executed through two engines: the D2 lowering plus CedarSharp (schema-carrying, request validation on) and the upstream Dogwood authorizer oracle (dogwood-language 929f49e). Expectations are hand-derived from the fixture and from the upstream three-tier entity-store semantics; they are not copied from either engine's output.",
